"subdirectori). `zfr about -d -r` mostra els camps d’empaquetatge. La versió "
"per a Meson/RPM és `zfr version`. `zfr ize` aplica les millores debian/rpm/"
"meson/man/version-subst que manquen."

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:41
msgid "no rpm/*.spec (optional, but zephyr style includes RPM next to debian/)"
msgstr ""
"no hi ha rpm/*.spec (opcional, però l’estil zephyr inclou RPM al costat de "
"debian/)"

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:44
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Copy rpm/ from a language template; name the spec after the package (rpm/"
"<Source>.spec, not zephyr.spec) and keep a Makefile using `zfr version`. "
"Align Name/Summary/Requires/URL with debian/control. Or run `zfr ize`."
msgstr ""
"Copieu rpm/ d’una plantilla de llenguatge; anomeneu l’spec pel paquet (rpm/"
"<Source>.spec, no zephyr.spec) i mantingueu un Makefile que usi `zfr "
"version`. Alineeu Name/Summary/Requires/URL amb debian/control. O executeu "
"`zfr ize`."

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:63
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "spec Version is dynamic %{version}"
msgstr "Version de l’spec és dinàmic %{version}"

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:72
msgid "spec Version is hardcoded; zephyr style injects `zfr version`"
msgstr "Version de l’spec està fixat; l’estil zephyr injecta `zfr version`"

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:76
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Use Version: %{version} with %{!?version:%global version 0.0.0} and freeze "
"via rpm/Makefile (`zfr version` / `zfr version -r`)."
msgstr ""
"Useu Version: %{version} amb %{!?version:%global version 0.0.0} i congeleu "
"via rpm/Makefile (`zfr version` / `zfr version -r`)."

#: src/zfr_lib/lint/rpm.py:82
